---
/* ===========================================================================
   invoice-desk.astro - the old Invoice Desk address, forwarding only
   ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
   The Invoice Desk became the TCP Back Office (/back-office/) on 22 Nov 2026
   ("TCP Back Office: Design Specification v1.1", section 8). This page only
   sends the browser on, so old bookmarks and sign-in emails still work.

   It passes on everything after the path unchanged, character for character:
   the query ("?...") and the whole fragment ("#..."). A Supabase sign-in link
   carries its sign-in details (or the reason it failed) in the fragment, so
   nothing is lost. The page reads none of it. location.replace keeps this
   address out of the Back button's history.

   Kept out of search engines, like the Back Office itself.
   =========================================================================== */
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
<meta name="referrer" content="no-referrer">
<title>TCP Back Office</title>
<script is:inline>location.replace("/back-office/" + location.search + location.hash);</script>
</head>
<body>
<noscript><p>The Invoice Desk is now the <a href="/back-office/">TCP Back Office</a>.</p></noscript>
</body>
</html>
